  triage:title "AC7: no test exercises 4 concurrent graft sessions under induced daemon restart" ;
  triage:description "qa-pr1181-r1 (msg 01M1QS4C69FTKB887D5K0V12Y8) at 9f4d3170e: req-qa: sprint-AW.4 AC7 requires a test proving fallback-line integrity and no lost outcomes with 4 concurrent graft sessions while the daemon is restarted; no such test exists. CLOSURE (qa-cipher-fix, quality-mgr): Cipher's fd11bbeac added four_concurrent_sessions_survive_restart_without_corrupt_fallback_lines (crates/atm-graft-python/src/lib.rs, mod tests). Non-vacuous: 4 real OS threads synchronized via std::sync::Barrier hit an initial transport that always fails with daemon_unavailable, then a replacement transport that succeeds; asserts all 4 outcomes recover (outcomes == [0;4]), exact call counts (initial_calls==4, replacement_calls==4), and inspects the actual fallback JSONL file content: 12 lines (3 events x 4 sessions), each line individually well-formed (starts/ends correctly, no truncation/interleaving), and exact per-event-type counts (4 RECOVERY_ATTEMPT, 4 DAEMON_UNAVAILABLE, 4 RECOVERY_RESULT). quality-mgr ran the test directly at fd11bbeac: PASS. Finding closed." ;
